# The photo-gallery tool and its suite. A self-contained local CLI (EXIF
# parsing + a static gallery), unrelated to the panel: nothing shipped
# imports it, and every other mention of the name in this directory is a
# sample app id in a Shadow fixture, not a path. Ignored rather than
# committed so it stops holding the release's clean-tree check hostage; the
# files stay on disk and still run.
